      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\" ac:breakout-mode=\"default\"><ac:layout-cell><h2>About the Feature</h2><p>Once a Medication / Drug or prescription ordered by the doctor from Clinical Services app, same can be seen as a quotation in Odoo with Draft status. This section describes about confirming and delivering the ordered drugs.</p><ac:adf-extension><ac:adf-node type=\"panel\"><ac:adf-attribute key=\"panel-type\">note</ac:adf-attribute><ac:adf-content><p>The following steps and screenshots are explained as per Odoo 10, available on Bahmni 0.92 release.</p></ac:adf-content></ac:adf-node><ac:adf-fallback><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" style=\"background-color: rgb(234,230,255);border-color: rgb(153,141,217);border-width: 1.0px;\"><div class=\"panelContent\" style=\"background-color: rgb(234,230,255);\">\n<p>The following steps and screenshots are explained as per Odoo 10, available on Bahmni 0.92 release.</p>\n</div></div></ac:adf-fallback></ac:adf-extension><h2>Used By</h2><p>This feature is used by Pharmacist.</p><h2>How is it Used?</h2><h3>1. Updating &amp; confirming the drug order</h3><ol><li><p>Click on the &ldquo;Sales&rdquo; menu appearing in the navigation menu at the top of the screen in <strong>Odoo</strong> application.</p></li><li><p>Click on the &ldquo;Quotations&rdquo; option in the left panel appearing under the &ldquo;Sales&rdquo; to navigate to the &ldquo;Quotations&rdquo; screen, which will be listing the Draft Quotations of various patients.</p></li><li><p>Search the quotation of the desired patient entering the patient name or identifier in the search field appearing at the top right of the screen.</p></li><li><p>Click on the searched quotation to view the prescription order sent from the service unit for the respective patient.</p></li><li><p>Click on the &ldquo;Edit&rdquo; button appearing at the top left side of the screen.</p></li><li><p>Update the quantity of drugs in the &ldquo;Order Lines&rdquo; if required.</p></li><li><p>Select the desired batch in the Batch No. column field for each product. Once the batch is selected, accordingly the sale price will get populated in the &ldquo;Unit Price&rdquo;. </p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"428\" ac:original-width=\"854\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"SQmBBt_ol9EfxOkZTHqk7NVctVjozca_bmTKaDn77iyVRDEa7tPq1gUuPxpaj0Kwr3OAZzGSD1SBifMCPhHmC04LwX2LR1vsGJWzVCkMmPHwManwRPZ6TND3Iez7nbevZDTRoqwS\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><p /></li><li><p>Click on the &ldquo;Confirm Sale&rdquo; button, which will confirm the sales.</p></li></ol><ac:adf-extension><ac:adf-node type=\"panel\"><ac:adf-attribute key=\"panel-type\">note</ac:adf-attribute><ac:adf-content><p>&ldquo;Unit Price&ldquo; will populate on select the batch for a product only when the &ldquo;<strong>Markup - Determine sale price based on cost price markup</strong>&ldquo; flag kept checked under   Sales &gt; Configuration &gt; Settings &gt; Quotations &amp; Sales.</p></ac:adf-content></ac:adf-node><ac:adf-fallback><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" style=\"background-color: rgb(234,230,255);border-color: rgb(153,141,217);border-width: 1.0px;\"><div class=\"panelContent\" style=\"background-color: rgb(234,230,255);\">\n<p>&ldquo;Unit Price&ldquo; will populate on select the batch for a product only when the &ldquo;<strong>Markup - Determine sale price based on cost price markup</strong>&ldquo; flag kept checked under   Sales &gt; Configuration &gt; Settings &gt; Quotations &amp; Sales.</p>\n</div></div></ac:adf-fallback></ac:adf-extension><h3>2. Create Invoice for a confirmed sale order</h3><ol><li><p>To create invoice, click on &ldquo;Create Invoice&ldquo; button appearing at the top left corner of the screen in a confirmed Sale Order.</p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"414\" ac:original-width=\"843\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image-20200331-104816.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><p /></li><li><p> Select desired invoice option in the popup and click on &ldquo;Create Invoices&rdquo; button.</p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"189\" ac:original-width=\"490\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image-20200331-105146.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><p /></li><li><p>Click on &ldquo;Invoices&ldquo; icon appearing at the top right corner of the quotation, which will navigate to the Invoice screen displaying the Invoice details.</p></li><li><p>Click on &ldquo;Validate&rdquo; button appearing at the top left corner of the sale order and then on the &ldquo;Register Payment&rdquo; button, which will open &ldquo;Register Payment&rdquo; popup.</p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"226\" ac:original-width=\"527\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image-20200331-105620.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><p /></li><li><p>Select the payment type, enter the payment amount and click on &ldquo;Validate&rdquo; button in the popup. </p></li></ol><ac:adf-extension><ac:adf-node type=\"panel\"><ac:adf-attribute key=\"panel-type\">note</ac:adf-attribute><ac:adf-content><p>When &ldquo;<strong>Skip Invoice Options</strong>&rdquo; flag in Settings &gt; Users &gt; Users &gt; Technical Settings is kept checked for logged in user, Invoice will get created automatically on &ldquo;Confirm Sale&rdquo; action and &ldquo;Register Payment&rdquo; popup will appear for payment details. </p></ac:adf-content></ac:adf-node><ac:adf-fallback><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" style=\"background-color: rgb(234,230,255);border-color: rgb(153,141,217);border-width: 1.0px;\"><div class=\"panelContent\" style=\"background-color: rgb(234,230,255);\">\n<p>When &ldquo;<strong>Skip Invoice Options</strong>&rdquo; flag in Settings &gt; Users &gt; Users &gt; Technical Settings is kept checked for logged in user, Invoice will get created automatically on &ldquo;Confirm Sale&rdquo; action and &ldquo;Register Payment&rdquo; popup will appear for payment details. </p>\n</div></div></ac:adf-fallback></ac:adf-extension><h3>3. Deliver the drug(s) from the confirmed drug sale order</h3><ol><li><p>Once sale is confirmed, a delivery order (for any stockable line item) will be created and can be accessed by clicking the &ldquo;Delivery&rdquo; icon appearing in the right side of the screen.</p></li><li><p>In the delivery screen, you can view the available quantity of the drug in the selected lot.</p></li><li><p>Click on the list icon appearing in the product grid and enter the delivered quantity of drug in the &ldquo;Done&rdquo; field under the &ldquo;Lot/Serial Number Details&rdquo; popup.</p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"215\" ac:original-width=\"531\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image-20200331-110550.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><p /></li><li><p>Click on the &ldquo;Validate&rdquo; button appearing at the top left side of the screen to deliver the Done quantity of drugs and the same quantity will get reduced from the selected batch of inventory.</p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"316\" ac:original-width=\"840\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"LURsdJ4ozIdsxXP-XlBpZfO64OAkU4lwuoe3z4etANEbBE7PqMG9JAuinMxuqdsVHIw1MxnpLMbIEs10gamENnSzBkSeP4KEEte2K4-n-IUcmdA8HW0wTA64MSeUqC28Vy2FV3Pc\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><p /></li></ol><ac:adf-extension><ac:adf-node type=\"panel\"><ac:adf-attribute key=\"panel-type\">note</ac:adf-attribute><ac:adf-content><p>When &ldquo;<strong>Delivery - Validate delivery when order confirmed</strong>&rdquo; flag kept checked under   Sales &gt; Configuration &gt; Settings &gt; Quotations &amp; Sales, the drug will get delivered automatically on &ldquo;Confirm Sale&rdquo; option if demanded quantity is available.</p></ac:adf-content></ac:adf-node><ac:adf-fallback><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" style=\"background-color: rgb(234,230,255);border-color: rgb(153,141,217);border-width: 1.0px;\"><div class=\"panelContent\" style=\"background-color: rgb(234,230,255);\">\n<p>When &ldquo;<strong>Delivery - Validate delivery when order confirmed</strong>&rdquo; flag kept checked under   Sales &gt; Configuration &gt; Settings &gt; Quotations &amp; Sales, the drug will get delivered automatically on &ldquo;Confirm Sale&rdquo; option if demanded quantity is available.</p>\n</div></div></ac:adf-fallback></ac:adf-extension></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"toc\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" data-layout=\"default\" ac:macro-id=\"1a9db005-20b6-4355-ad3b-e064bb506b97\" /><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"d13f43cf-d0b7-4789-b407-667328552620\"><ac:rich-text-body><p><strong>Feature Details</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32604205/Pharmacy+Management\">Feature Guide - Pharmacy Management</a> </p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"23fe8f8d-4be3-4797-ae44-37929ec80a75\"><ac:rich-text-body><p><strong>Implementation Details</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32014590/Pharmacy+Configuration\">Implementer's Guide - ERP Modules - Pharmacy Configuration</a> </p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\" ac:breakout-mode=\"default\"><ac:layout-cell><p /></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><p /></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"fixed-width\" ac:breakout-mode=\"default\"><ac:layout-cell><p /></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
